        "id": "intro-comment",
        "type": "nodetool.workflows.base_node.Comment",
        "data": {
          "comment": "# Widen a Mono Voice\n\nSpeaks a line and places the mono voice in a stereo field. Most text-to-speech returns mono, and a stereo mix needs both channels.\n\n**How it works:** \"1 Line\" holds the text. \"2 Speak\" turns it into speech, \"3 Mono to stereo\" copies the voice onto both channels, and \"4 Audio\" returns the stereo track.\n\n**Try this:** Pick a model and voice on \"2 Speak\", then replace the text in \"1 Line\" with your own sentence."
        },
